@model DualPath.Web.Pages.IndexModel
<div class="wrap"><div class="page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Internship Launchpad</div><h1>A practical path to<br>your <span class="serif">first opportunity.</span></h1><p class="lead">Build habits, sharpen your professional story, and practise the conversations that help you take the next step.</p></div><div class="grid2"><div class="stack"><p class="lead">You bring the ambition.<br>We bring a little structure.</p><p class="muted">Designed for high school and college students preparing for internships. Work at your own pace, or join a supported cohort through your institution.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/signup">Choose your starting point<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="/dashboard">Open your workspace</a></div></div><div class="card"><h3>What you’ll work toward</h3><div class="check"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg>A realistic weekly action plan</div><div class="check"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg>A researched outreach brief</div><div class="check"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg>A resume and clear project story</div><div class="check"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg>A professional relationship map</div><div class="check"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg>Structured interview practice</div><div class="check"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg>Personalized drills based on your work</div></div></div><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your learning path</div><h2>Purposeful practice,<br>from start to next step.</h2></div></div><div class="module-rows"><a class="module-row" href="/lesson"><span class="num">01 /</span><h3>Discipline & ownership</h3><p>Turn good intentions into a weekly plan, reflect on setbacks, and follow through.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a class="module-row" href="/lesson"><span class="num">02 /</span><h3>Cold email fundamentals</h3><p>Research people, write a specific ask, and follow up with purpose.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a class="module-row" href="/lesson"><span class="num">03 /</span><h3>Resume & portfolio proof</h3><p>Translate projects into clear evidence of what you can do.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a class="module-row" href="/lesson"><span class="num">04 /</span><h3>Networking & relationships</h3><p>Prepare for conversations and nurture professional relationships.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a class="module-row" href="/lesson"><span class="num">05 /</span><h3>Interviewing & negotiation</h3><p>Practise specific examples, thoughtful questions, and offer conversations.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a><a class="module-row" href="/lesson"><span class="num">06 /</span><h3>Personalized practice</h3><p>Target skill gaps using your completed assessments and reflections.</p><span class="round-link"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div></section><div class="cta"><div><h2>Start with where you are.</h2><p>Your first step is a short goals check-in.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/signup">Find your path<svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></svg></a></div></div>